### Preserve a provider-log snapshot before thumbnail captures

**Severity:** `low`

For local test runs, a failed capture or view-size assertion now exits before the provider log is attached. `CleanupTest` collects module logs only through the pipeline-only branch in `UITestBase`, so it does not recover this diagnostic attachment locally. The previous ordering attached the log before captures. Preserve an initial snapshot here and keep the existing final read and generation-failure check after all captures; failed CI runs already collect their logs separately.

```suggestion
        var initialProviderLogPath = ArtifactPath($"{scenario}-provider-initial", ".log");
        File.WriteAllText(initialProviderLogPath, ReadAllTextWithRetry(providerLog!));
        TestContext.AddResultFile(initialProviderLogPath);

        var extraLarge = CaptureStableFileItem(explorer, assetName, $"{scenario}-extra-large");
```

**Verification:** force a capture failure during a local thumbnail test and confirm the initial provider log is attached; on a successful run, retain the final post-capture failure classification.
